		<key>PayloadDescription</key>
		<string>(24December2024v1) Disables various apps from running on macOS, such as Tips, Feedback Assistant, Crash Reporter, etc. After installation, you will see  a pop-up on first boot after logging in with the message: "You don't have permission to use the application "seedusaged." Simply select 'OK' &amp; ignore this. seedusaged is part of Apple's Feedback Assistant (https://macosbin.com/bin/seedusaged) used for collecting &amp; reporting data.</string>
